# Hello, board
# Level 1 - Basics
#
# Your first program: the board says hello, then counts the seconds.
# You learn: the 'board' line, 'at start:', 'every', variables and print.
# You need: just the board and its USB cable. Open the serial monitor to see the messages.

board uno                          # every program starts with the board it is for

var seconds = 0                    # a variable: a value the program can change

at start:                          # runs once, when the board powers up
    print "Hello! I am an {board.name}."

every 1 s:                         # runs again and again, once a second
    seconds += 1
    print "I have been awake for {seconds} seconds"
